          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Google Breaks Ground on AI Data Centre in Visakhapatnam as Part of $15B India Investment",
            "articleSection": "Discovery & Research",
            "abstract": "Google has officially broken ground on its AI data centre in Visakhapatnam, marking a concrete construction milestone in its announced $15 billion, five-year commitment to build a gigawatt-scale AI ecosystem in India. The facility is expected to become a major node in Google's Asia-Pacific AI infrastructure, providing cloud compute capacity to Indian enterprises, government bodies, and research institutions. The groundbreaking follows a series of high-level government engagements and positions Andhra Pradesh as a central geography in India's AI infrastructure buildout.",
            "url": "https://yourstory.com/2026/04/google-breaks-ground-on-ai-hub-in-visakhapatnam",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
